---
<Base title='California neurodegenerative disease registry bill moves forward; new momentum on dementia research, prevention, and early detection | End Chronic Disease' shareTitle='California neurodegenerative disease registry bill moves forward; new momentum on dementia research, prevention, and early detection' description='SB 1047 would add frontotemporal degeneration to California’s registry, as new research links ultra-processed foods to dementia risk and identifies warning signs years before diagnosis.' css={[style]}>
